{"seq":17,"slug":"meituan","title":"美团企业管理与组织文化","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":25,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan","rating":{"composite":4.03,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.11,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"美团企业管理与组织文化-简介\">美团企业管理与组织文化 简介</h1><p>美团作为中国最大的本地生活服务平台，从2010年千团大战的激烈竞争中脱颖而出，发展为覆盖外卖、到店、酒旅、闪购、出行等多元业务的超级平台。创始人王兴以&quot;长期有耐心&quot;为核心管理哲学，打造了一套独特的企业文化与组织管理体系，支撑着这家员工超10万人的互联网巨头持续进化。</p>\n<p>本知识库从七个维度系统梳理美团的企业管理实践。**第一章「文化与价值观」**深入解读&quot;长期有耐心&quot;的核心理念、以客户为中心的服务哲学、正直务实的价值观体系，以及使命演变、王兴管理哲学和无边界扩张文化。**第二章「绩效体系」**剖析美团独特的OKR与绩效评估双轨制、管理者review机制，以及数据驱动的评估方法论。**第三章「组织与人才」**探讨美团的扁平化组织架构、城市经理模式与地推铁军的运作方式，以及&quot;从战争中培养将军&quot;的人才发展路径。**第四章「战略与方法论」**分析美团无边界扩张的商业逻辑、高频打低频的竞争策略，以及地推铁军的标准化方法论。**第五章「职级与薪酬」**全面解析L序列职级体系、薪酬结构和绩效评估生存指南。**第六章「职业路径」**深度拆解工程师、产品经理、运营与城市经理、销售与BD四大核心岗位的发展路径。**第七章「AI变革」**分析美团的AI应用全景和战略布局，以及AI时代员工的实践指南。</p>\n<p>美团的管理实践既有互联网公司的数据驱动与快速迭代基因，又融合了传统地面作战的铁军执行力，形成了独树一帜的管理范式。2026年，面对AI时代的全新挑战，美团正在推动&quot;去登味&quot;的组织文化变革，以更扁平、更敏捷的姿态迎接下一个十年。无论是互联网从业者、管理研究者，还是创业团队，都能从美团的组织实践中获得有价值的启发。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"long-term-patience","title":"美团「长期有耐心」— 王兴的管理哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values/long-term-patience"},{"seq":2,"slug":"customer-first","title":"美团以客户为中心 — 消费者与商户的双侧服务哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values/customer-first"},{"seq":3,"slug":"integrity-pragmatism","title":"美团正直诚信与务实高效 — 价值观落地的组织实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values/integrity-pragmatism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-evolution","title":"美团使命演变 — 从\"帮大家吃得更好\"到\"零售+科技\"战略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values/mission-evolution"},{"seq":5,"slug":"wang-xing-philosophy","title":"王兴的管理哲学与互联网思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values/wang-xing-philosophy"},{"seq":6,"slug":"values-system-evolution","title":"美团价值观体系的演变与落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values/values-system-evolution"},{"seq":7,"slug":"boundaryless-long-patience","title":"无边界扩张文化与\"长期有耐心\"理念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/culture-and-values/boundaryless-long-patience"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"okr-plus-performance","title":"美团 OKR + 绩效评估双轨制 — 方向对齐与结果导向的融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/performance-system/okr-plus-performance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"manager-review","title":"美团管理者 Review 机制 — 干部选拔与管理梯队建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/performance-system/manager-review"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-driven-assessment","title":"美团数据驱动评估 — 业务结果导向的绩效量化方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/performance-system/data-driven-assessment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flat-organization","title":"美团组织扁平化 — 反官僚主义的持续战争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/org-and-talent/flat-organization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"city-manager-model","title":"美团城市经理模式 — 地推铁军的组织载体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/org-and-talent/city-manager-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"talent-development","title":"美团人才培养体系 — 从战争中培养将军","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/org-and-talent/talent-development"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/meituan/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"boundary